      <h2>Why Professional Upholstery Cleaning Matters</h2>
      <p>
        Upholstered seating traps fine dust, allergens, body oils and everyday residues. Professional cleaning helps maintain appearance, improve comfort and extend the
        lifespan of your sofa, sectional and armchairs.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Professional Method</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Full pre-cleaning fabric inspection.</li>
        <li>Fiber-specific pre-treatment with professional shampoo.</li>
        <li>Steam cleaning with hot water extraction.</li>
        <li>Floor and pathway protection during setup and cleaning.</li>
        <li>Powerful extraction for fast drying, typically between 2 and 6 hours.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Furniture We Clean</h2>
      <p>
        We clean sectional sofas, modular sofas, loveseats, armchairs, upholstered dining chairs, banquette seating and ottomans. Every piece is treated according to
        fabric composition, soil level and usage pattern.
      </p>

      <h2>Specialized Treatments Available</h2>
      <p>
        Based on the initial assessment, we can add targeted stain treatment, odor neutralization, enzymatic treatment and optional fabric protection. We recommend only
        what is relevant for your specific upholstery condition.
      </p>

      <h2>Why Homeowners in Brossard Choose Empire</h2>
      <p>
        With over 30 years of experience, our team combines technical precision, eco-friendly products and consistent service quality. We focus on clean execution and
        reliable results for homeowners who expect professional standards.
      </p>

